  "constructor_protocol": "Exact class/complete immutable source/profile/policy checks through class-owned public configuration ports before methods or hooks. Configuration/dependency binding performs no diagnosis, callback, storage, grant or activation. The logical lifecycle is bound to one exact original configured owner; no arbitrary owner registry or duck typing.",
  "lifecycle_completion_protocol": "Only the exact issued ticket may complete, at most once. The exact bound owner authenticates its actual original result via its class-owned owned-result port and same operation reference. Failed/late result remains actual; confirmed target receipts permit KNOWN_COMPLETE, partial receipts KNOWN_PARTIAL, unknown physical outcome UNKNOWN; these statuses do not confer world/branch persistence.",
  "conditional_inputs": {
    "narrative": "archetype_context null skips evaluation and interpretation. Nonnull requires configured archetype_registry and effective_truth: explicit truth_input, else actual perception_request.truth. No source yields preflight REFUSED/CORE_PROVENANCE_MISSING/truth_input before new capture or effects; absent registry yields CORE_CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE/archetype_context.",
    "truth_conflict": "When explicit truth_input and perception_request.truth are both supplied, their complete canonical bytes must equal; otherwise preflight REFUSED/CORE_FACT_CONFLICT/truth_input. No empty graph is fabricated.",
    "perception": "perception_request null skips overlay. Otherwise its actual truth/provenance is validated at the corresponding stage; an existing input graph is used unchanged, never synthesized from bits or narrative output.",
    "realm": "realm_request null skips access/shift. Otherwise evaluate access; eligible true authorizes pure shift proposal, false/refused or unavailable/pending stops following ordinary stages and retains access result.",
    "projection": "Configured tuple defaults to empty (typed NO_OP snapshot, no fabricated profile facts). Unique pattern IDs sorted ASCII; mask indexes actual final destination integer0..511. Empty codeword_ids is no trace restriction; otherwise at least one actual canonical trace member must intersect. Matched strength is configured strength, otherwise0; every row retains full actual trace and source refs.",
    "links": "Each recurrence/myth/prophecy feature contributes its coefficient once iff its own context ref set intersects the record evidence_refs. Those refs remain declared interpretation inputs, not host-verified activation."
  },
  "raw_admission": "Exact request plus bounded complete-refusal framing must fit1MiB before ticket/capture/effect. Preserve closing allowance. Oversize actual issued peer return stays complete API-only with REFUSED/CORE_RESOURCE_LIMIT and no following ordinary stage; serializers raise rather than clipping. PE-owned emit receipts retain their own cap and are not relabeled Core packets.",
  "grant_call_ownership": {
    "CoreOrchestrator.run": 11,
